      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s an interesting idea but it wouldn\u0027t work, at least not at the moment. There are a number of problems:\n1. It is not designed to support that use case, so would be a lot of work to make that happen. ATM bcpf assumes that it is in an APEX, and has a non-empty set of contents.\n2. We could not make it work just like another bcpf (e.g. perform hidden API processing) because it would create a cycle between bcpfs.",
